  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2d954b5538343e620bb23ef94ebabc84492b02f4812ca3a727f64dca6e1e18a1.png] \n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\nOption 1) 9 × 3 - 4 ÷ 2 + 5 = 4\n\nBy interchanging the given two sign: × and ÷\n\n⇒ __**9 ÷**____** 3**__ - 4 × 2 + 5 = 4\n\n⇒ 3 - __**4 × 2**__ + 5 = 4\n\n⇒ __**3**__ - 8 __**+ 5**__ = 4\n\n⇒ **8 - 8** = 4\n\n⇒ 0 = 4\n\n**Option 2) 11 ÷ 12 × 6 + 8 - 10 = 20**\n\n**By interchanging the given two sign: × and **÷\n\n⇒ 11 × __**12 ÷ 6**__ + 8 - 10 = 20\n\n⇒ __**11 × 2**__ + 8 - 10 = 20\n\n⇒ __**22 + 8**__ - 10 = 20\n\n⇒ __**30 - 10**__ = 20\n\n**⇒ 20 = 20**\n\nOption 3) 5 + 6 × 2 - 4 ÷ 1 = 10\n\nBy interchanging the given two sign: × and ÷\n\n⇒ 5 + __**6 ÷ 2**__ - 4 × 1 = 10\n\n⇒ 5 + 3 - __**4 × 1**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**5 + 3**__ - 4 = 10\n\n⇒ __**8 - 4**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 4 = 10\n\nOption 4) 70 ÷ 3 × 7 + 50 - 10 = 80\n\nBy interchanging the given two sign: × and ÷\n\n⇒ __**70 × 3 ÷ 7**__ + 50 - 10 = 80\n\n⇒ __**30 + 50**__ - 10 = 80\n\n⇒ __**80 - 10**__ = 80\n\n⇒ 70 = 80\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
